  "details": "Allows any member in a specific group to auto join any world you are in. This way, for one example, when someone opens an inv only sleep world for sleep time, their friends can still join them. \n\nA second way could be if someone opens an inv only but has to afk for some time and a friend is trying to get to the friend group to socialise, if they are in the instance creators group they can get in.\n\nA third example is that it can also make role playing more organic/realistic when a member from the group can just join a private instance without it being known for storyline ",
